# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Projects, and everything derived from them.
#
# static_driver/<run>/ holds one project: its configuration, the palm_csd
# inputs, the drivers, the plots and the intermediate data. It is ignored in
# full, for two separate reasons.
#
#   The data is reproducible and enormous. One driver runs from a few hundred
#   MB to several GB -- past GitHub's 100 MB per-file limit -- and the working
#   directory beside it is 20 MB per km2 at 1 m, so a city is 50-100 GB.
#
#   The configuration is private. A run config names a site, an author, an
#   institution and a study. Only what is generic enough to publish stays in
#   repository/config: the region files, the template and the smoke test.
#
# Note that .gitignore does not untrack a file that is already tracked; use
# `git rm --cached` for that.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
static_driver/*
!static_driver/README.md

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The example is the exception, and is versioned in full.
#
# It is the only project small enough to be: three nested domains over 9 km2
# give a few MB of drivers in total, against 166 MB for the smallest of
# the real runs. Committing it means somebody who clones this repository has a
# working driver to open before running anything, and somebody who runs it has
# something to compare their own result against -- which is what makes it a
# test as well as an example.
#
# Its work/ directory stays out: 187 MB of intermediates that the run rebuilds.
#
# git needs the directory un-ignored before anything inside it can be, hence
# the re-ignore on the second line.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
!static_driver/example/
static_driver/example/*
!static_driver/example/config/
!static_driver/example/docs/
!static_driver/example/products/
!static_driver/example/example_static
!static_driver/example/example_static_N02
!static_driver/example/example_static_N03

repository/.cache/*
!repository/.cache/README.md

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
out/
out_*/
work/
work_*/

__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

.DS_Store
*.swp
